{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415032","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415032","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041503201:1":{"text":"아, 샤키탈리스! 또 여기서 게으름을 피우고 있군!","source_cn":"啊，萨基塔里斯！你又在这里偷懒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE77E753B4F63A71F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041503202:1":{"text":"탈렌이구나. 반갑네. \n서로 못 본 지 벌써 몇백 년이지?","source_cn":"是塔琳啊，真巧。\\n我们是不是有几百年没见过面了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE83DF9A47871220A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041503203:1":{"text":"응, 전에 나한테 약간의 문제가 좀 생겨서 말이야... \n말 돌리지 마!","source_cn":"嗯，我之前稍微出了点状况——\\n别岔开话题！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6F9FBE8AFA1C8FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041503204:1":{"text":"그러지 말고, 탈렌, 우리의 재회를 축하하기 위해 오늘 밤 내 파티에 오지 않겠어?","source_cn":"别这样，塔琳，为了庆祝我们的重逢，今晚要不要来我的宴会？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BBD7A92DDE570A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041503205:1":{"text":"널 위해 특별 공연도 준비하지. 황금색과 붉은색의 꽃으로 장식한 다음, 시인 몇백 명이 너를 위해 노래를...","source_cn":"我可以为你准备一处专场，用黄金和火红的花朵装饰，再请上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E4D0ABFEF2BAEFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041503206:1":{"text":"무, 무슨 노래를 한다는 거야? 난 요즘 유행하는 노래는 너무 시끄러워서 좋아하지 않아.","source_cn":"唱、唱什么？我可不喜欢最近流行的曲子，太吵闹了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29AD035C50BC2CC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041503207:1":{"text":"내 센스를 아직도 못 믿는 거야?\n내 파티에서는 스칼리타도 제대로 즐겼을 정도라구. ","source_cn":"你对我的品味还不放心吗？\\n连斯克嘉莉德都能在我的宴会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CCF774FA7A0A360","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041503208:1":{"text":"흠... 그럼 조금 있다 멋진 헤어를 준비해야겠네...","source_cn":"哼……那我等会儿就得准备下发型……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0FA09AB046F8C67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041503209:1":{"text":"잠깐! 너 때문에 또 다른 데로 샜잖아!","source_cn":"等等！又被你岔开话题了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C25B355C5060369","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:塔琳":{"text":"탈렌","source":"塔琳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:萨基塔里斯":{"text":"샤키탈리스","source":"萨基塔里斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":2}}